1
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,080
《打工姐妹花》前情提要
Previously on 2 Broke Girls...

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,560
台风正朝着威廉斯堡迎头而来
The hurricane is headed right for Williamsburg.

3
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:07,920
街上帽子被吹得满天飞
Fedoras are blowing down the streets,

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,020
精酿啤酒洒得满地都是
craft beers are spilling everywhere,

5
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:12,560
独立音乐乐团练习取消
and indie bands are cancelling practice.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,780
这就是为什么兰迪还没来
This explains why Randy isn't here yet.

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,800
他估计是被困暴风雨里了
He's probably stuck in the storm.

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,020
他不接 直接转去语音信箱了
He's not answering and it's going straight to voicemail.

9
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:25,100
他很可能屏蔽你电话了
He probably blocked you.

10
00:00:25,720 --> 00:00:27,060
我们真的彻底分手了
We're really broken up.

11
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,180
先去抱抱我们的甜品吧
Let's go hug our dessert bar.

12
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,760
它一定吓坏了
It was probably so scared.

13
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,020
天啊 麦克斯
Oh, my God, Max.

14
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,140
我们的甜品酒吧就这么毁了
Our dessert bar is destroyed.

15
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:39,519
看来我们是时候该面对现实了
I think we have to finally admit it to ourselves.

16
00:00:39,519 --> 00:00:40,662
我们就是衰神
Ugh, we're cursed.

17
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,620
老天爷绝对跟我有仇
Yeah, this is personal.

18
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:48,320
别这样 我一年级时那个吉普赛人
Come on, when that gypsy pointed at me in first grade

19
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,900
对着我念"大[罩]杯咒" 那才叫诅咒
and said, "Biggus Boobus," that was a curse.

20
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,980
我们肯定不是唯一一家
I'm sure we weren't the only business

21
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:54,280
台风受灾户
that was ruined by the storm.

22
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,560
我们才没有被衰神附身
We're not cursed.

23
00:00:57,300 --> 00:00:59,480
现在还开始有刺痛感了
Yeah, now it's starting to burn.

24
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:04,300
我选择将这场灾难当做一个启示
Well, I am choosing to take this disaster as a sign.

25
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:06,460
而且我们又不是没保保险
It's not like we don't have insurance.

26
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,300
在他们重建这里的时候
And while they're rebuilding this place,

27
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:11,240
我要去给兰迪惊喜 重建我们感情
I'm gonna go surprise Randy and try to rebuild us.

28
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:12,800
看出这关联了吗
You see the parallels?

29
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,820
你懂 你肯定听懂了
You get it. She gets it.

30
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,360
姑娘们 你们听说了吗
Girls, did you hear?

31
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:21,280
整个区域只有一家商户
Turns out only one business in the entire area

32
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:22,580
受风灾影响
was affected by the storm.

33
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:24,620
真好奇是哪家...
I wonder which one...

34
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:29,680
这事就先归类为"之后再说的事"吧
File this under "Story For Another Time"?

35
00:01:35,316 --> 00:01:36,579
污中生奶变变变
Biggus Boobus!

36
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,080
老娘真是服了
Ugh, I don't believe this!

37
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:54,280
所有的机场停飞 仿佛我的心情般
All the airports are more shut down

38
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,560
大吃"闭门羹"
than I am emotionally.

39
00:01:56,640 --> 00:01:58,540
厄尔 你搜到没停摆的大巴或火车了吗
Earl, have you had any luck with any busses or trains?

40
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,620
在查了
I'm on it.

41
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,140
我该按哪个按钮才会有网
What button do I push for the Internet?

42
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,620
我刚跟保险公司通完电话
I just talked to the insurance company.

43
00:02:04,780 --> 00:02:06,380
他们会赔偿所有的损失
They're gonna pay for all our repairs.

44
00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:07,840
还多给了我们一点额外补贴
And they gave me some extra money

45
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:09,180
因为我跟他们说我们俩是孕妇
'cause I told them we were pregnant.

46
00:02:10,180 --> 00:02:12,160
能先关注一下我怎么去洛城这件事吗
Can we please focus on how I'm gonna get to L.A.?

47
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:15,020
我明明不要脸又有广为流传的性爱影带
I have low self-esteem and a well-viewed sex tape.

48
00:02:15,020 --> 00:02:16,080
我人早该在那里才对啊
I should be there already!

49
00:02:17,220 --> 00:02:19,440
麦克斯 我尽量说得不伤你心
Max, I'm gonna try to put this delicately.

50
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:22,340
但你现在就像个疯狂变态跟踪狂
You're acting like a cray-cray psycho stalker.

51
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,720
我才不是跟踪狂
I am not a stalker.

52
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:26,260
我都是被人家跟踪的那个
I'm the one that gets stalked.

53
00:02:26,460 --> 00:02:28,180
说到跟踪狂 我应该通知一下盖瑞
That reminds me, I should probably tell Gary

54
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:29,140
我要出远门
I'm going out of town.

55
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,100
他能不知道吗
Oh, he knows.

56
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:33,380
他今早在家门口脚踏垫拉了祝一路平安屎
He left a bon voyage dookie on our welcome mat this morning.

57
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:35,480
但贺卡挺贴心的啊
But the card was sweet.

58
00:02:36,920 --> 00:02:38,800
那我作为你的闺蜜
Well, then as your best friend,

59
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,800
我要陪你去 确保你平平安安
I am going with you to make sure you're okay.

60
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:43,160
兰迪给过我航空公司礼券
You know, Randy did give me an airline voucher

61
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:45,080
就是我第一次毁了感情那会给的
when I ruined our relationship the first time.

62
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,880
我估计可以拿去换到两张票
I could probably get two tickets for that,

63
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,060
这样我就有地方放脚了
so I could put my feet up.

64
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:50,460
或者也可以让你跟来啦
Or I guess you could come.

65
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:53,600
如果我是你跟踪任务的帮手
If I'm the wing-lady on your stalking mission,

66
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:55,600
那这我要宣布这次是度假之旅啦
I'm gonna go ahead and call this a vacation.

67
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,340
好可悲啊
Wow, that's sad.

68
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,660
好啦 我差不多要上去网啦
All right, I'm almost on the Internet.

69
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:02,260
有人知道我的解屏密码吗
Does anybody know my password?

70
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:03,960
是"Earl"[厄尔]
It's "Earl."

71
00:03:04,620 --> 00:03:07,300
没错 用的是我第一只狗的名字
Oh, right, my first dog's name.

72
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,320
大家安安
Hey, everybody!

73
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:17,280
我跟芭芭拉的一个小伙伴
I just got in a fight with one of Barbara's friends

74
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,680
在宜家球池里吵起来了
in the IKEA ball pit.

75
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,620
你想带宜家肉球丸子进球池
Yeah, if you're gonna bring meatballs in there,

76
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:23,440
那就得带够给所有人都能吃的份
you gotta bring some for everybody.

77
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,660
球池里的肉球丸子再多也不嫌多啊
Yeah, there's never enough meatballs in a ball pit.

78
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,580
厄尔 我们去洛杉矶的事怎么样了
Earl, how we doing on our trip to L.A.?

79
00:03:29,580 --> 00:03:31,560
租车店的车全租出去了
Well, the rental cars are rented out,

80
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:34,700
火车停摆 航班停飞到周二
trains are down, and no flights till Tuesday.

81
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:37,340
我还收到了表情包发来的短信 谁是表情包
And I got a message from emoji. Who's emoji?

82
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:42,260
你们何不公路旅行开车过去
Hey, why don't you two just road trip it?

83
00:03:42,540 --> 00:03:44,720
后车厢带着一冷却箱的啤酒
You know, throw a cooler of beer

84
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:47,780
以及手撕猪肉条 然后就头也不回上路
with pulled pork in the trunk and just go, baby.

85
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:50,560
要不是我有个要喂奶的大娃
I would do the same if I didn't have

86
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,480
我也想这样去旅行
that giant breastfeeding baby.

87
00:03:53,180 --> 00:03:54,640
我说的是奥列格
I'm talking about Oleg.

88
00:03:56,044 --> 00:03:59,300
我能建议你们开我卖给阿憨的丰田小车吗
May I suggest the Toyota Yaris I sold to Han?

89
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:00,540
它很省油
It's efficient on gas,

90
00:04:00,540 --> 00:04:02,900
而且后车厢无法从车里打开呢
and the trunk can't be unlocked from the inside.

91
00:04:03,780 --> 00:04:06,220
你们别想开我的车
Oh, no! You're not taking my car.

92
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,160
这次轮到我载我的缝花被子俱乐部
It's my turn to drive my quilting group

93
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,180
去农贸市场了
to the farmers' market.

94
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:11,980
阿憨 我们可以来硬的
Han, we can do this the hard way

95
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:14,060
就是你不给我钥匙 我把你内裤拉到你头上
where you don't give me the keys and I give you a wedgie,

96
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:16,560
或是你乖乖配合 交出车钥匙
or the easy way where you do give me the keys

97
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,340
我拉你内裤套头时下手轻点
and I give you a slightly less intense wedgie.

98
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:21,220
车钥匙就在我办公室里 但你别想...
The keys are in my office, but you're not...

99
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:22,700
靠 我说溜嘴了
Oh, dear, I've said too much.

100
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,840
你猜这场龙争鼠斗谁会赢
Who do you see winning this one?

101
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:28,440
我先告诉你 麦克斯为了防这种情况
And you should know, Max keeps a pocket full of sand

102
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,440
永远带了一口袋的沙子
for these kinda things.

103
00:04:30,638 --> 00:04:32,149
叮当到手 小婊子们
Jingle-jangle, bitches!

104
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:36,180
就你刚才的行为 我就该炒了你
You should be fired for what happened back there.

105
00:04:36,500 --> 00:04:38,260
猴子偷桃是禁止的
Bathing suit areas are off limits.

106
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:40,940
行吧 开我的车去
Fine, use my car,

107
00:04:40,940 --> 00:04:42,460
但必须是我来驾驶
but I'm going to be driving it.

108
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,620
我要跟你去
I'm coming with you.

109
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:46,780
我好不容易才把短腿油门辅助器调到位
I finally got the gas pedal extension where I like it.

110
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:48,860
那谁来管餐厅啊
But who's gonna run the diner?

111
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:53,020
对了 我曾经营过一家挺成功的"小保健"
FYI, I managed a pretty successful jerk shack for years.

112
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:55,000
恶心鬼奥列格
Ew, Oleg.

113
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:57,480
干嘛啦 你别想歪好吗
What? Get your mind out of the gutter.

114
00:04:57,580 --> 00:04:59,260
我们卖牙买加风味鸡肉
We sold Jamaican-style chicken.

115
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:01,700
来给我们的小保健打掩护
As a front for full-release massages.

116
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,360
问一下 我第一只狗的名字叫啥来着
Y'all, what was my first dog's name again?

117
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:08,180
-厄尔 -干嘛
- Earl. - What?

118
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:12,560
看来管店人选只有奥列格跟厄尔了
I guess my only options here are Oleg and Earl.

119
00:05:12,826 --> 00:05:15,397
哎妈 一时之选 个个要命啊
Woof, real Murderers' Row.

120
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,540
那服务员怎么办
Who are you gonna have waitress?

121
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:19,020
他们还得能跟得上
'Cause you know they'll have to match

122
00:05:19,020 --> 00:05:22,240
由我搭档与我亲自设下的超超低标准呢
the extremely low bar set by my associate and myself.

123
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:25,760
能让我当吗
Oh, can I do it?

124
00:05:26,473 --> 00:05:27,786
我开什么玩笑呢
Oh, who am I kidding?

125
00:05:28,540 --> 00:05:29,620
我当然可以
Or course I can!

126
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:32,780
我曾经在波头鹰餐厅当过服务员
I actually used to be a waitress at Pooters.

127
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:35,660
你是说猫头鹰餐厅吗
You mean Hooters?

128
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,600
不 我那个是波兰版的
No, it was Poland's version.

129
00:05:39,020 --> 00:05:41,020
我们那里女服务员下半身不穿
Yeah, all the waitresses were bottomless.

130
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:44,380
那希望你们那里戴了很多"发网"啊
I'm hoping there were a lot of hairnets involved.

131
00:05:44,886 --> 00:05:47,020
按理说是该这样...
Oh, you'd think so.

132
00:05:51,420 --> 00:05:53,240
阿憨 我本来想说你开车像老太婆
Han, I'd say you drive like a little old lady,

133
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,960
但已经三个老太婆超我们车了
but three of them just passed us.

134
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:58,460
我开车载我的毒舌朋友尼尔去医院吸水泡
I had more fun driving my bitchy friend Neil

135
00:05:58,500 --> 00:05:59,960
都没载你们闹心
to get his blisters drained.

136
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:02,280
所以现在有啥计划了没
Also, what's the strategy here?

137
00:06:02,340 --> 00:06:03,800
都已经开了好几小时车了
We've been driving for hours.

138
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:06,300
等我们找到没关闭的机场
Well, once we find an open airport,

139
00:06:06,420 --> 00:06:08,960
我们就飞去洛城 麦克斯就给兰迪个惊喜
we'll fly to L.A., where Max will surprise Randy,

140
00:06:08,960 --> 00:06:10,500
然后她就用舌头狂甩兰迪
and she'll be all, "Ahhh,"

141
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,340
然后兰迪也跟她...
and he'll be all, "Ahhh."

142
00:06:14,419 --> 00:06:17,783
首先 兰迪学得太像
First of all, great Randy impression.

143
00:06:17,783 --> 00:06:20,547
差点就忍不住给你来点...
I almost gave you a little "Wahhh""

144
00:06:21,057 --> 00:06:22,719
你们俩的事先计划
You girls have less of a game plan

145
00:06:22,719 --> 00:06:25,622
比《美国恐怖故事》任何一季的剧情还少
than any season of American Horror Story.

146
00:06:25,993 --> 00:06:28,205
而且谁需要什么计划啊
Well, who really needs a game plan anyway?

147
00:06:28,205 --> 00:06:30,348
我现在可是在度假啊
I'm on vacation, baby.

148
00:06:30,408 --> 00:06:32,751
你看 说出来都不会掉泪了
See? Didn't even tear up that time.

149
00:06:33,422 --> 00:06:35,134
这些零食都是咋回事
What's with these snacks?

150
00:06:35,134 --> 00:06:36,125
蔬菜干
Vegetables?

151
00:06:36,125 --> 00:06:38,227
你又再吃什么兔子瘦身饮食了吗
Are you on that bunny diet again?

152
00:06:38,417 --> 00:06:40,980
不是 而且我吃了还胖了呢
No, I gained weight on that somehow.

153
00:06:41,961 --> 00:06:44,985
阿憨 你好多摇滚乐团咕咕玩偶的盘啊
Han, there's a lot of Goo Goo Dolls here.

154
00:06:44,985 --> 00:06:48,269
还有咕咕偶之现场咕
GGD-Live Goo. Wow.

155
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:50,602
你凭啥要听一个
I'm taking music criticism

156
00:06:50,602 --> 00:06:53,275
跳梁小丑的脑残粉批评我的音乐口味啊
from a proud member of the Juggalo nation?

157
00:06:53,275 --> 00:06:54,617
给我片白萝卜干
Hand me a radish.

158
00:06:57,620 --> 00:07:00,984
白萝卜是要嚼多久才正常啊
I mean, how long are you supposed to chew a radish?

159
00:07:00,984 --> 00:07:01,956
一辈子吗
Forever?

160
00:07:02,716 --> 00:07:04,918
我能给你们介绍个小景点
Can I interest anyone in a side trip

161
00:07:04,918 --> 00:07:06,500
去松泉谷玩吗
to Pine Creek Gorge?

162
00:07:06,500 --> 00:07:07,700
如果你们喜欢大峡谷
If you love the Grand Canyon,

163
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:10,260
你们也会觉得这宾州小峡谷也还行
you'll think Pine Creek Gorge is pretty good.

164
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,980
我勒个大去
Oh, my seasonal gourd.

165
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,220
看看兰迪的新快拍
Look at Randy's Snapchat story.

166
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,840
连律师都有自己的休息拖车
they even got the lawyer is own trailer.

167
00:07:21,969 --> 00:07:24,144
不对 不是自己的
Oh! Scratch that.

168
00:07:24,260 --> 00:07:25,800
我还跟一只非常大的蝎子分享
I'm sharing it with a very large scorpion.

169
