对不起
So sorry.

320
00:14:13,450 --> 00:14:15,350
我不知道喇叭会这么大声
I didn't know the horn would be so loud,

321
00:14:15,370 --> 00:14:16,850
但你能不能让开点
but could you scooch?

322
