334
00:14:45,450 --> 00:14:47,190
谢谢你啊 乌溜溜秀发的贝姬
Thanks, Becky With the Good Hair.

335
00:14:47,450 --> 00:14:49,330
你会找到真爱的 我确定
And you'll find someone, I'm sure.

336
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:51,090
你勇敢追爱就行了
You just gotta go for it.

337
