339
00:14:59,890 --> 00:15:02,750
我们好像还没正式自我介绍 邋遢乔
I don't think we've formally met, Sloppy Joe.

340
00:15:03,110 --> 00:15:04,530
我叫卡洛琳·钱宁
I'm Caroline Channing.

341
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:06,950
到时候我们的死讯将会一起被报导
They'll be reporting our deaths together.

342
00:15:07,930 --> 00:15:09,430
我不会跟你们一起的
You're on your own there.

343
00:15:09,890 --> 00:15:11,970
我五年前就被人报导去世了
They reported mine five years ago.

344
00:15:13,290 --> 00:15:15,910
我们坐的是幽灵飞机吗 太屌了
We're on a ghost plane? Awesome!

345
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:19,290
好奇一问 机上会有餐饮服务吗
Just curious, will there be a beverage service?

346
00:15:19,290 --> 00:15:20,870
想来两口我的啤酒吗
You want some of my beer?

347
00:15:21,110 --> 00:15:23,890
不用了 大半瓶都撒我身上了
That's all right, you already spilled most of it on me.

348
00:15:24,170 --> 00:15:26,170
所以人家才说他邋遢啊
I bet that's why they call him Sloppy.

349
00:15:26,690 --> 00:15:29,090
不 我的落地是一塌糊涂才对
Nope, my landings are a mess.

350
00:15:30,550 --> 00:15:32,210
卡洛琳 要往好的方面想嘛
Caroline, look at the bright side.

351
00:15:32,430 --> 00:15:34,350
怎么想 所有指示灯都坏了
How? None of the lights work.

352
00:15:34,803 --> 00:15:36,390
我们正在去洛杉矶的路上
We're on our way to L.A.,

353
00:15:36,390 --> 00:15:38,690
而邋遢哥收了兰迪的礼券当报酬
and Sloppy took Randy's voucher as payment.

354
00:15:39,010 --> 00:15:41,410
再用礼券卷了一管大麻
And then rolled a nice, fat joint with it.

355
00:15:42,110 --> 00:15:43,270
这还用说
You bet I did.

356
00:15:45,090 --> 00:15:46,410
穿越雷劫
Ride the lightning!

357
00:15:47,911 --> 00:15:48,466
你们也叫
Do it back.

358
00:15:48,710 --> 00:15:49,370
让我也听听你们这么叫唤
Let me hear you say, "Yee-haw!"

359
00:16:03,430 --> 00:16:04,990
我很庆幸你找到我了
I'm just glad you found me.

360
00:16:05,170 --> 00:16:06,890
我差点就要去搭个小屋过夜了
I was about to build a hut for the night.

361
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:09,850
你不是说你不接陌生男人的吗
I thought you said you didn't pick up strange men.

362
00:16:09,850 --> 00:16:10,770
的确是啊
I didn't.

363
00:16:11,290 --> 00:16:14,190
但我的新朋友说服我要勇于尝试
Until a new friend convinced me I gotta take a chance.

364
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:19,750
这台老东西能多快啊
How fast can this old rig go?

365
00:16:20,430 --> 00:16:23,590
这"老东西"能整晚不用停
This old rig can go all night, baby.

366
00:16:24,990 --> 00:16:26,710
完全答非所问
Doesn't answer my question at all,

367
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:29,990
不过既然如此 那就来吧
but let's do the damn thing.

368
00:16:39,170 --> 00:16:42,090
这趟旅程比我想象中还颠簸啊
This flight's a lot bumpier than I thought it was gonna be.

369
00:16:42,350 --> 00:16:43,410
说到颠簸
Speaking of bumps,

370
00:16:43,690 --> 00:16:44,850
你们那里有没有一"颠"白粉
y'all don't have any blow, do you?

371
00:16:46,410 --> 00:16:47,870
这趟旅程现在最需要的
Yeah, that's what this flight needs,

372
00:16:47,870 --> 00:16:49,110
就是一个更神经兮兮的机长了
a more jittery pilot.

373
00:16:51,590 --> 00:16:53,190
兰迪又贴了新的影片
Randy just posted a new video.

374
00:16:53,398 --> 00:16:55,389
缓冲快一点啊
Eh, buffer faster!

375
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:57,050
你在这上面有信号吗
Ugh, do you get any bars up here?

376
00:16:57,290 --> 00:16:59,970
我如果有信号就不用问你们有没有白粉了
If I did, I wouldn't be asking you for cocaine.

377
00:17:01,730 --> 00:17:04,290
没关系 不需要等信号了
Never mind, don't need it.

378
00:17:04,850 --> 00:17:05,930
我们要下去了
We're going down.

379
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:08,930
下去 我最不喜欢听人这么说了
Going down? My least favorite expression.

380
00:17:08,930 --> 00:17:10,490
我现在又更讨厌这词了
And now I hate it even more.

381
00:17:11,450 --> 00:17:13,170
至少这版本的"下去"
At least in this version of going down

382
00:17:13,170 --> 00:17:14,830
完事后不需要抱抱啊
you don't have to spoon afterwards.

383
00:17:16,350 --> 00:17:17,530
天啊
Oh, my God!

384
00:17:17,850 --> 00:17:19,630
卡洛琳 天大好消息
Caroline, amazing news.

385
00:17:20,170 --> 00:17:21,110
你找到降落伞了吗
You found parachutes?

386
00:17:21,110 --> 00:17:23,090
或者是飞机断掉的那节机翼
Or that part of the wing that tore away?

387
00:17:23,790 --> 00:17:25,310
不是的 我们早死定了
Ha, oh, no, we're goners.

388
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:28,110
但乌云背后有一道幸福线
But Silver Linings Playbook,

389
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:31,070
那根手指是兰迪妈妈的
that finger belonged to Randy's mom!

390
00:17:31,450 --> 00:17:32,990
她去片场找他
She's visiting him on set.

391
00:17:33,050 --> 00:17:35,110
而且她长得都没想象中好看
Ah, and she's not even that cute.

392
00:17:35,330 --> 00:17:37,690
等我们上天堂 我一定不原谅你
I am gonna be so mad at you in heaven.

393
00:17:38,570 --> 00:17:39,810
你觉得我会上天堂吗
You think I'm going to heaven?

394
00:17:40,350 --> 00:17:42,010
她居然觉得我会上天堂
She thinks I'm going to heaven.

395
00:17:44,450 --> 00:17:46,630
飞机太重了 我们得丢掉一些重量
Plane's too heavy. We gotta drop some weight.

396
00:17:47,630 --> 00:17:51,390
我就知道在卡车休息站的时候 不该吃那薯条
I knew those curly fries at the truck stop were a mistake,

397
00:17:51,390 --> 00:17:53,850
可是他们那里也没有卖健康的其他选择啊
but they didn't offer a healthy alternative.

398
00:17:53,850 --> 00:17:55,730
-拿着这个 -什么
- Hold this. - What? Ohh!

399
00:17:56,850 --> 00:17:59,130
邋遢哥 天空是在这边
Hey, Sloppy, the sky is that way!

400
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:02,190
我也喜欢这个
I like this, too.

401
00:18:03,570 --> 00:18:05,690
必须得丢掉行李箱
This suitcase has gotta go.

402
00:18:06,130 --> 00:18:07,770
不行 我所有的衣服都在里面
No, all my clothes are in there.

403
00:18:07,850 --> 00:18:09,710
我们所有的钱 我们的信用卡
All of our money! Our credit card!

404
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:12,050
那么小的一个箱子
There is no way that that one tiny suitcase

405
00:18:12,050 --> 00:18:14,090
怎么可能给你飞机造成那么大的问题
is causing all these problems with your plane.

406
00:18:21,650 --> 00:18:23,390
好吧 可能是我打包太多东西了
Very well, perhaps I overpacked.

407
00:18:26,290 --> 00:18:27,090
上啤酒
Beer me.

408
00:18:32,298 --> 00:18:33,163
上菜
Pick up!

409
00:18:33,250 --> 00:18:35,670
除非你对"上"有意见
Unless that's a huge problem for you.

410
00:18:36,870 --> 00:18:37,590
够了
That's it.

411
00:18:38,490 --> 00:18:40,330
我要对你说我当年
I'm gonna tell you the same thing

412
00:18:40,330 --> 00:18:41,610
对波头鹰餐厅
that I told Pooters

413
00:18:41,610 --> 00:18:44,070
要给制服加上裤子时说的话
when they added pants to the uniform.

414
00:18:46,490 --> 00:18:47,770
老娘不干了
I quit.

415
00:18:48,690 --> 00:18:49,550
你不干了吗
You quit?

416
00:18:49,810 --> 00:18:51,730
不不不不不不
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

417
00:18:52,490 --> 00:18:53,350
你是被炒了
You're fired.

418
00:18:54,550 --> 00:18:55,830
是吗
Oh, yeah?

419
00:18:57,230 --> 00:18:57,870
是的
Yeah!

420
00:18:59,010 --> 00:19:01,190
因为我是个"坏"女服务员吗
Have I been a bad waitress?

421
00:19:04,330 --> 00:19:05,290
最坏最调皮的那个
The naughtiest.

422
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:13,470
他们不会就这么在餐厅里做爱吧
Uh, they're not gonna have sex in a restaurant, are they?

423
00:19:14,070 --> 00:19:16,270
这也不会是第一次了
Well, it wouldn't be the first time.

424
00:19:16,570 --> 00:19:19,070
连第八次都不是了
Hell, it wouldn't be the eighth time.

425
00:19:20,678 --> 00:19:23,744
"上"菜啦 奥列格
Pick up, Oleg.

426
00:19:24,030 --> 00:19:26,170
是的 兄弟 真要开"干"啦
Oh, yeah, man. This is happening.

427
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:31,590
我就是那时候娶了我高中的女朋友
And that's when I married my high school sweetheart.

428
00:19:31,950 --> 00:19:33,950
她当时还在读高中 而我38岁了
Well, she was in high school. I was 38.

429
00:19:34,830 --> 00:19:37,030
又一个妙极了的故事啊 邋遢哥
Another terrific story, Sloppy.

430
00:19:37,390 --> 00:19:39,390
差点就让我忘了我们没钱
Almost makes me forget we have no money,

431
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:42,450
没衣服 而且这趟旅程连里程数都换不到
no clothes, and we're getting zero mileage for this flight.

432
00:19:42,450 --> 00:19:44,810
塞翁失马焉知非福
Silver Linings Playbook, though.

433
00:19:45,150 --> 00:19:46,290
小兰迪又更新了
Little Randy update.

434
00:19:46,370 --> 00:19:47,910
麦克斯 我不在乎要多贵
Max, I don't care how expensive it is.

435
00:19:47,910 --> 00:19:49,890
我们回去后你必须得去做心理治疗
You are going to therapy when we get back.

436
00:19:51,010 --> 00:19:52,830
我们在奥斯丁 德克萨斯州拍摄的第一天
Well, that's a wrap on the first day of filming

437
00:19:52,830 --> 00:19:53,708
就到此结束啦
here in Austin, Texas.

438
00:19:53,708 --> 00:19:54,942
或者用当地人的话来说
Or as they say around these parts,

439
00:19:54,942 --> 00:19:56,840
别德惹州人
don't Tess with Mexas.

440
00:19:58,250 --> 00:19:59,710
还有被蝎子蛰后别喝酒
Don't drink on a scorpion bite.

441
00:20:01,830 --> 00:20:03,390
他说得没错啊
The man ain't wrong.

442
00:20:04,290 --> 00:20:06,710
等等 所以兰迪不在洛杉矶吗
Wait, so Randy's not in Los Angeles?

443
00:20:06,730 --> 00:20:07,590
他是在德州
He's in Texas.

444
00:20:08,210 --> 00:20:10,470
麦克斯 你真是个蹩脚的跟踪狂
Wow, you're a bad stalker, Max.

445
00:20:10,579 --> 00:20:13,390
邋遢哥 随便左转还右转
Sloppy, hang a Ralph or a Louie.

446
00:20:13,390 --> 00:20:14,770
转哪边能去德州就转哪边
Whatever gets us to Texas.

447
00:20:15,250 --> 00:20:17,390
我邋遢平生有两件事不做
Eh, there's two things that Slop won't do.

448
00:20:17,730 --> 00:20:19,790
告知相关单位我的飞行模式
Alert the proper authorities of my flight pattern

449
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:21,610
以及踏进德克萨斯州
or step foot in Texas.

450
00:20:22,890 --> 00:20:24,630
你们得自己去了
You need to make your own way there.

451
00:20:24,930 --> 00:20:26,990
我在这里放你们下 我刚好也得去嘘嘘
I'll drop you here. I gotta whiz anyway.

452
00:20:29,310 --> 00:20:30,790
这里放我们下
Ah! Drop us here?

453
00:20:30,870 --> 00:20:32,490
嘘嘘 这是什么意思
Whiz? What does that mean?

454
00:20:33,290 --> 00:20:35,070
我想他的意思是我这个月
Uh, I think it means I'm jumping out

455
00:20:35,070 --> 00:20:36,810
要跳第二次机了
of another plane this month.

456
00:20:36,810 --> 00:20:41,010
告诉你啊 我好想念餐厅啊
You know what? I miss the diner.
